> 2. If I blast a fountain apart and make pools everywhere, then get
> "neked", grab stuff I want to blank/dilute, what are my chances of
> drowning? I kept getting the message "You sink like the Titanic. You
> crawl to the edge. Phew, that was close." or something like it. Not

If you wear an amulet of magical breathing or are polymorphed to something
that doesn't need to breathe, you'll dive and survive under the surface
until you go back to dry land yourself..
Otherwise, you always crawl out if you are unburdened and there is an
available square of dry land next to the water square (this may not always
be the case if some monster just comes to the only possible dry square..).
AFAIK, if you are stressed or worse, you don't climb out but drown.
I'm not sure about burdened.

