> 5. Why is praying lots bad? It seems from my experience that I WANT to
> boost my luck to a certain level (mostly to avoid crowning), pray,
> then zap away with my wands of create monster and sacrifice to appease

There is the random prayer timeout. If it hasn't expired yet, your god
will not like hearing you praying.. If you haven't done anything bad, you
should be able to safely pray about 1000 turns after either your previous
prayer or receiving a gift from your god.

